        {
          "id": "2104952602710638877",
          "url": "https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2104952602710638877",
          "text": "@jukan05 Hello, this is Tibo, you’ve reached the wrong company. Let me redirect you to …",
          "at": "2026-09-29T15:13:03+00:00",
          "is_reply": true,
          "text_zh": "@jukan05 您好，我是Tibo ，您联系错了公司。让我将您重定向到……"
        },
        {
          "id": "2104951965184925941",
          "url": "https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2104951965184925941",
          "text": "I’ll explain the new Pro 200 plan differently, before I start live tweeting from DevDay on things that are going out!\n\nToday we are going to ship a number of things that increase what you can do across the Plus and Pro plans. A lot of compute is online for this increase. As we increase the floor, we are changing the relative difference between plans to be\n\nPlus = 1X\nPro 100 = 5X\nPro 200 = 10X\n\nand we are reopening subscriptions for Pro 200 (we had paused it). If you have an existing plan you will keep the 20X multiplier for a bit and also receive a lot of additional credits because we know changes are hard even if it means that everyone will get more in the end.",
          "at": "2026-09-29T15:10:31+00:00",
          "is_reply": false,
          "text_zh": "在我从DevDay开始实时推特之前，我将以不同的方式解释新的Pro 200计划！\n\n今天，我们将推出一些东西，增加您在Plus和Pro计划中可以做的事情。为了实现这一增长，大量的计算都在线。随着我们增加下限，我们正在改变计划之间的相对差异，\n\nPLUS = 1X\nPRO 100 = 5X\nPRO 200 = 10倍\n\n我们正在重新开放Pro 200的订阅（我们已暂停）。如果您有一个现有的计划，您将保留20倍的乘数，并获得大量的额外积分，因为我们知道即使这意味着每个人最终都会获得更多的变化也很难。"
        },
